        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pentastar: In the Style of Demons, Plymouth Barracuda\n- People/Roles: Earth\n- Topics: album covers, automobiles\n\nFacts:\n- The Plymouth Barracuda is a two-door car that Plymouth manufactured for the 1964 through 1974 model years.\n- Pentastar: In the Style of Demons is the third full-length studio album by the drone doom band Earth.\n- The cover of Pentastar: In the Style of Demons depicts a \"Sassy Grass Green\" Plymouth Barracuda with its iconic hockey-stick decal altered to say \"Earth.\"",
